{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_folnic_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_folnic_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"明日之前","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_folnic_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"6fa457d790dc1ad54b3b1c03b8d5495272c533a8cdfd34b4660a8a39dc30028c","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"一支前往乌萨斯的罗德岛队伍出发在即，亚叶找到泥岩，希望她帮自己筹办一场惊喜派对，同时，她似乎有事情要宣布——","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodeslounge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......谢谢。这堆报告太多了，怎么都放不好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？是泥岩啊，你刚回来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"这次外勤去了多久，快一个月了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，这次还挺久的，不过接下来可以休息了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亚叶医生，你看起来......状态不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"有吗？大概是这两天咖啡喝多了，气色不太好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又在勉强自己了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"没有啦，只是最近确实有点忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我们组织了一支前往乌萨斯的队伍，本舰的人现在都忙得不可开交呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，现在得叫总部才对......不过反正你也能理解，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。乌萨斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"很快就会正式公布了，直接告诉你也没关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅和博士打算组织一支精锐队伍前往乌萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......难怪我回来的时候感觉大家都很忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，泥岩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......你现在有空吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"帮我个忙吧。我想在食堂举办一场派对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"派对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"对，我想邀请几个马上要前往乌萨斯的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这和我有什么关系？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要一些帮手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......亚叶医生，我想你应该知道，以我们之间的关系......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是那个合适的人选吗？我可以帮你筹办派对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在沃伦姆德发生的事情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得，我都记得。那时候我甚至想过要用药剂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说话还是很直接。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"现在也一样。虽然你那时并没有做出伤人的举动，但如果你的源石技艺失控威胁到罗德岛，我还是会毫不犹豫地对你采取措施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信你会的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，为什么......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"正因为我们不那么熟，甚至可以说......正因为我们曾经立场不同，我想，现在才是最好的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_rhodescorner"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......要找什么来着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"一个箱子，上面应该写了我的名字......说起来，真不可思议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我们就这么在同一个地方工作了几年。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你劝我留下的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我也犹豫过。我问过自己，我能不能忍受跟你们在同一个地方生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到都过了这么久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你得出答案了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"还没有，不过至少我刚才邀请你的时候，没有觉得怎么样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了，在这。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我来吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"一些我来到罗德岛时带的行李，先前外派到办事处，离开本舰时，我把它们都带走了。现在想起来，好像是某种预兆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不是没跟你说过，我是怎么来到罗德岛的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像说过一次，你只提到是凯尔希医生派人去乌萨斯把你接过来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那时候，罗德岛才刚刚成立呢，距离后来的切尔诺伯格行动也还有一段时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"听说凯尔希老师要带我走，我还以为要去什么地方，就一股脑地准备了许多根本派不上用场的东西，比如这个——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......乌萨斯的便携式源石炉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"帮我把它拆开，我要看看里面的喷嘴还能不能用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这种型号很老旧了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在罗德岛配备的源石电能加热模块，体积只有它的三分之一，加热效率却是它的两倍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我要用它给大家煮一锅汤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么非要用这个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"泥岩，你去过乌萨斯的冻原吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是听说过。那是连源石技艺都会被冻结的死地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。在真正的极寒面前，那些精密的器械并不可靠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"当气温降到零下五十度，当源石风暴切断了所有电路的时候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"只有这种丑陋的、笨重的、燃烧着液化源石的东西，才能救你的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"小时候，我觉得这股气味很难闻，熏得人流眼泪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在......我觉得它很让人安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"只要这团火还能被点燃，就意味着我还没被那片白色的地狱吞噬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你对这个炉子这么执着，不仅仅是为了煮汤吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我要确保它能一次就点燃，没有任何故障。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"看，它还很有活力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"就像我母亲当年一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜我没有我母亲那么勇敢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......至少，在沃伦姆德，你敢于直面那些暴徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"那是鲁莽。老师说过，只有活下来的人才有资格谈勇敢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"泥岩，你知道吗？罗德岛的加热器虽然高效，但煮出来的东西总是少了一点味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"那种带着一点点烟熏味，汤汁在猛火下翻滚，把肉香完全逼出来的味道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"那是“家”的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅他们要去的地方很冷，是真正的苦寒之地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望他们在野外宿营的时候，能喝到一口用这种炉火煮出来的热汤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我想让他们觉得，即便是在暴风雪里，家也还在身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......家的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（为了让阿米娅他们在野外也能喝到热汤......？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不。你要确保它在“不可能生存”的环境下也能工作。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（你是为那支出行的队伍准备的吗？还是说，你是为你自己准备的？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，泥岩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，火试过了，没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我们去下一站。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"除了准备吃的，我们还得给今晚的客人们准备一些“惊喜”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的房间，比我想的要杂乱许多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"没办法，我实在没力气收拾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以帮你收拾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，每次我努力收拾过房间之后，就会更加找不到东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"这些土偶......你在帮我打扫卫生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不喜欢杂乱的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是再次觉得，我跟你确实不怎么合得来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，还是谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你还需要打扫卫生，可以找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，还是让你的土偶来帮我打包吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打包？这些是......礼物盒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧。我打算在今晚的派对上设一个抽奖环节。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抽奖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"对啊。既然是派对，总得有点让人期待的环节吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"而且这次派对邀请的对象是即将外出的大家，阿米娅、博士，还有其他干员们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我想给他们准备一些真正有用的礼物，但是直接送的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道的，阿米娅肯定会推辞，说“亚叶姐姐留着自己用就好”，博士也肯定会说什么“物资要优先分配给有需要的人”之类的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你打算用抽奖的方式送出去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"没错。如果是凭运气抽到的“奖品”，他们就不好意思拒绝了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"泥岩，帮我把桌上那些扎着彩带的盒子递给我。对，就是那些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些盒子包得很精致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"帮我看看，这个蝴蝶结打得怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很漂亮。但这里面装的是什么？感觉很沉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"你打开最上面那个看看。那里面是今晚的特等奖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是，笔记本？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《源石技艺与草药学研究笔记》......还有《针对乌萨斯极寒环境的急救手册》？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是你的手稿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。这上面记录了我跟随凯尔希老师这几年所有的学习心得，还有我对沃伦姆德地区特殊病例的研究。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"里面还有一些......在我母亲的研究基础上展开的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是你作为医生最宝贵的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对于医生来说，这些笔记就是武器，就是生命。你要把它们作为......抽奖的奖品？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，如果你把它们送人了，你自己怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还要继续研究，继续治病救人。没有了这些笔记，你会很不方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来的很长一段时间，我恐怕......用不上它们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我也没精力再去搞这些细致的研究了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"放在我这里是浪费，给去乌萨斯的大家更有用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用不上......了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。我要去做别的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"泥岩，你看这满屋子的东西。我这几天一直在想，其实人活着真正需要的东西并不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"像这些书、这些仪器，还有这件我已经穿习惯了的旧大衣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不能带走，留着也只是徒增牵挂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"不如送给需要它们的人。这样，就算我不在了，这些东西还能继续发挥作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，没什么，开始打包吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"多亏了你帮忙，泥岩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的准备都完成了吗？如果都完成了，那——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"泥岩，我有件事想拜托你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"你能不能......帮我送一份请柬？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请柬？给谁的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"给你，还有和你一起留在罗德岛上的你的同伴们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你从一开始就打算邀请我们，才会喊上我，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"你愿意吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们过去几年一起出任务的次数也不算少了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是那时，我也并不讨厌你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他们，在沃伦姆德，他们是你的敌人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕是现在，在罗德岛上，他们也一直很自觉地避开你，怕和你起冲突。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。我当然知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"那段记忆......充满了火光和愤怒。我曾经恨不得将他们全部驱逐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，正因如此，我才希望他们能够出席。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我要宣布的事情，和他们也有关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"泥岩，这次行动很多情报不明，大家不知道什么时候才能回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我想在大家出发前，和他们也聊一聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我想......不留遗憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不留遗憾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我现在不说，也许以后就再也没机会说了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们之间的仇恨已经可以放下，那么，我希望我们能够坦诚面对这一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"这里有一瓶莱塔尼亚的红酒，是我珍藏了很久的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"本来是想等凯尔希老师回来，庆祝的时候一起喝的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在，我觉得它有更好的去处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉他们，今晚的派对，我希望他们能来，我为他们准备了好酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亚叶医生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你把最珍贵的东西都拿出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"因为值得啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，快去吧。我也该去食堂做最后的准备了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"那锅汤，还得我亲自去看着火候呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"点燃那炉火，是为了在极寒的死地中寻找最后的生存希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是为了煮汤，而是为了在那片冻土上独自活下去。你要背着那个沉重的炉子，走上你母亲曾经走过的逃亡之路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把那些笔记打包成奖品是为了和过去做个告别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你放弃了医生的身份，把毕生的心血都送了出去。你甚至在担心直接送大家不会收，所以才费尽心思搞什么抽奖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而这瓶酒，这份给昔日敌人的请柬......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是为了清空所有的恩怨与遗憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医生，我猜到你想要宣布的消息是什么了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你决定了要走这条路，那我也该为你做点什么。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"narration","text":"灯光被调成了温暖的橘色，简单的彩带装饰着墙壁。\n几口大锅里正冒着热气，红菜汤的香味弥漫在整个空间。\n干员们三三两两地聚在一起，虽然脸上带着疲惫，但热食让他们放松了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，亚叶姐姐......这汤真好喝。感觉身体都暖和起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"喜欢就好。多喝点，阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯的冬天可是很漫长的。要记住这个味道啊，这就是罗德岛的味道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......亚叶医生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？泥岩，你来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"你的朋友们也来了，他们看起来很高兴。谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么了？看起来有点犹豫。你也来一碗吗？我特意给你留了肉多的一碗，就在锅里，用那个炉子一直温着呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，既然你来了，那我也该宣布我要说的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我来说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"你要说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白你的意思了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你把所有人都安排好了，唯独没有安排你自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"泥岩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你准备了在极地也可以用的炉具，却说效率不重要，只是为了“怀念母亲”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你把所有笔记当做奖品送人，是为了“切断牵挂”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你邀请昔日的敌人，甚至送出珍藏的酒，是为了“不留遗憾”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是在交代后事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"交代后事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你想去乌萨斯。你想去复仇，想用自己的命把凯尔希医生换回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都看到了。你做的那些准备，那根本不是为了生存，是为了毁灭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想拖累任何人，所以你把一切都送了出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我不能接受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你已经决定了，那我不会阻止你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，那些东西太重了，你一个人背不动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会替你守着那些你放不下的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会替你看着如今的罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你尽管去吧。去做你想做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......泥岩小姐，你是不是误会了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"停！打住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，大家，没事。只是我和泥岩的一点......小小的沟通问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"泥岩，跟我出来一下。立刻，马上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......这里应该没人了。泥岩，你真的......想太多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"天啊，你们萨卡兹的想象力都这么丰富的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想太多？可是你的准备......那些东西......还有你说的那些话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"听我说，泥岩。深呼吸，听我解释。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"第一，那个炉子，是给阿米娅他们准备的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"他们要在野外宿营，罗德岛的电热设备在极寒下不可靠，我不希望他们冻死在半路上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我把它找出来，是为了让阿米娅晚上能喝上一口热汤！是为了让他们能感受到家的温暖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是给阿米娅的？不是你要背着去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我背那个干什么？背着它我都跑不动！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"第二，把笔记当奖品送人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"泥岩，那是因为华法琳医生给我升职了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来我要面对的是无尽的行政报表和全舰医疗人员调配，我暂时没有时间做研究了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我就趁这个机会把自己目前学到的知识做了个阶段性的整理，正好可以交给要出发的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"第三，我邀请你的那些朋友，不是为了什么临终和解！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"当然不是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我要负责留守！基地的防御力量被抽调了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅要走，好几位精英干员要走，凯尔希老师也不在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"那时的罗德岛，会很脆弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"你和你的小队，将是基地防御体系里重要的一环。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我要和你们并肩作战，守住这个家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我还端着架子，对他们冷眼相待，万一敌人来了，我们怎么配合？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，你不去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅他们都去了，你是凯尔希医生的学生，你比任何人都更有理由去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你那么恨乌萨斯，那么想念你的母亲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，阿米娅邀请过我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"在商定名单的时候，她问我愿不愿意一起去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我拒绝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拒绝了？为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我有自知之明，泥岩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我的源石技艺，我的战斗能力，在那种级别的战场上，能发挥的作用很有限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我去了，只会成为阿米娅他们的负担。我不想让大家在执行任务的时候，还要分心来保护我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亚叶......你这是在看低自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"不，这是客观判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我恨乌萨斯。这一点永远不会变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"以前我觉得，只要杀回去，把仇人杀光就是复仇。但是凯尔希老师教会了我，仇恨不是驱动双脚的唯一燃料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"在罗德岛生活的时间越久，我越能感受到凯尔希老师对罗德岛倾注的心血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望，等她回来的时候，她见到的罗德岛，和她离开之前的没有任何区别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"到那时，我会骄傲地走到她的身边，告诉她，这里面有我的一份功劳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"也有你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，误会解除了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"食堂里的人还在等着我们呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你要守护这里，做这罗德岛的“锚”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我也留下来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会做一面盾。罗德岛的安保，交给我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会让那些小子听话的。他们会是最坚固的防线。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"噗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"那就拜托你了，泥岩。有你在，我确实安心多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，回去喝汤。汤要凉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚，就让我们好好为他们送行吧。作为留守者，作为罗德岛的后盾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_345_folnic","aliases":["亚叶"]}]}
